# NASA EONET v3 natural event, GeoJSON form: one Feature of the events/geojson
# FeatureCollection (one event geometry: a date paired with a location). Public domain
# (US Government work). Written by hand from the documented member list; pack.md states
# the evidence and what is not mapped.
format  eonet-event
version 0.1.0
distribution public
source  "NASA EONET API v3 documentation, Events (GeoJSON): https://eonet.gsfc.nasa.gov/docs/v3 (page sha256 b509a146bc9b10140a5258d2642f707b213e535c562e31a4076e8d0765a7fe5c, read 2026-11-20)"
uses    eonet
wire    geojson
field   lon          geometry.lon      float
field   lat          geometry.lat      float
field   uid          properties.id     string
field   callsign     properties.title  string
field   eonet.link   properties.link   string
field   time_ms      properties.date   iso8601_ms
